      ms: 6240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:zqv8k0'
    '|a||How sure are we? That good intentions can''t stand in for missing knowledge is consensus.':
